     "body": "<p>This feature was never merged in, and Fedora's code has changed significantly since.  There is also an effort underway to re-work Fedora's XACML implmentation based on the work done in the Muradora project.  See \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-451\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-451\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Fedora Enhanced Security Layer (FeSL) Integration\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-451\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n for more on that.  I'm closing this feature request for now in order to reduce confusion.  If anyone still wants IdReference support against the new XACML impl, please check whether it was done by FCREPO-451or submit as a new feature request.</p>",
